  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Rule of Law (RoL) and Enhancing Access to Justice(A2J) in The Gambia (RoL &amp; A2J)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNDP The Gambia&#x2019;s Rule of Law and Access to Justice (RoL &amp; A2J) project aims to strengthen justice institutions, enhance security, and ensure equitable access to justice, particularly for vulnerable groups, including women, youths, and persons with disabilities. Focused on regions most affected1 by security challenges, the project will address gender-based violence, empower communities, and enhance institutional capacity for fair dispute resolution</narrative>
  </description>
